        <mxCell id="60" value="Suggested import strategy" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#111827;strokeColor=#111827;fontColor=#F9FAFB;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="820" width="1250" height="120" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="61" value="1. Import PromptEntry + MediaAsset + PromptExampleLink first to build the prompt library.&#xa;2. Expose PromptEntry through FeedItem before forcing it into Video table.&#xa;3. Add PromptEntry -&gt; Video derived work relation later only when needed.&#xa;4. Always keep source_platform=youmind, source_campaign, and source_item_id for traceability.&#xa;5. Record all skipped items in ImportTask / AsyncTaskRecord, especially broken video, missing prompt, and damaged media." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#F9FAFB;fontSize=16;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="460" y="850" width="1190" height="80" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>

